# OR-002: Alcohol excess shifts esterification at fixed acid loading
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 CH3COOH 0.1mol
add v1 ethanol 0.1mol
react v1 esterification
new
add v2 CH3COOH 0.1mol
add v2 ethanol 0.3mol
react v2 esterification
inspect
